+# Reviewed status: 2518 / KOU-21.9
+
+**Unsolved, five of five substantive turns.** The complete independent source/proof review passes all scoped results. This additive wrapper updates the historical review-pending status without changing frozen author or review bytes. No full resolution or historical novelty is claimed.
+
+The exact source asks for a finite open-subgroup family of a finite-rank nonabelian free pro-p group, including the whole group, with no nontrivial common contained characteristic subgroup. The October 2026 Kourovka edition, printed177, and the September22,2026 primary commensurator paper, Question4 p53, retain this problem. Source links and exact edition mapping are in SOURCE_GATE.md.
+
+The packet proves an abelianized lattice obstruction, identifies the maximal common core by characteristic-core descent and an exact cofinality criterion, constructs all-depth lower-central witnesses with their precise p-adic valuations, and excludes finite-rank containers for a possible normal survivor. The final abelian and Heisenberg comparison groups expose a finite-quotient lifting failure; **they are not nonabelian free pro-p groups and are not counterexamples to the source question**. A possible infinitely generated common core remains unresolved.
+
+All36 author files and all5 independent-review files are preserved. Final author WIP:647033115e08e03872c5fcf01953a505b8ab2f0a. Author manifest SHA256:d498046adc568031857dc5b93d7e8049a591f4f128f73666208fd8de0e4f0d8a. Review report SHA256:1264289c80a1dbea171d776a5fd6c573fad5e32f0d3ebbe9a127e7ea6d0fd2d2. Review manifest SHA256:6ca9abdd890d5cead8ca8c5019396080121473b61867bb3654bf7ac4ea05b4a4.
+
+All139,300 author and153,807 independent exact bounded controls pass. The written proofs and credited primary theorems establish the universal claims; finite controls do not decide the original problem. Scripts use Python's standard library only. Run `python verify_publication.py` to validate public hashes and both replays. The public replay explicitly verifies zero raw source bindings because those PDFs/PNGs remain local-only; the historical receipt of12 local source bindings is retained unchanged. Optional source replay is documented in FINAL_RESULT.md.
+
+This draft changes only target artifacts and this target's QUEUE status/turn cells. Raw imports, PDFs/images and the unbound review working note are excluded. No merge or release is included.
